  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **On My Way Back To The Old Home**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **High On A Mountain Top**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **June Apple**: back after 90 archived shows (454 days); rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **instrumental**: back after 192 archived shows (1315 days) [3]\n- **You Ain't Goin Nowhere**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Margaritaville**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Just Because**: back after 232 archived shows (1478 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Midnight Blues**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-09-22.Soapbox** (recommended): source not stated; 14 songs; 88 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer found sound at secondary stages weaker; at the Thursday Center Camp set, mostly bass was audible near the low PA; Recording has wind noise since it was very windy, even inside the tent; noise reduction was tried but rejected [1][2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer stood up front, stage left; an extra PA stack was added the following day [2]\n- Thursday night's Center Camp set sounded better out in the campsite than near the stage [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-09-22.Soapbox**: taped by discocape; transferred by discocape; source: Beyerdynamic mc 930's [1]. Also: Recorded with Beyerdynamic MC 930 mics in ORTF, Mogami cables, Zoom H8 at 24/48; taped and transferred by discocape; Mics were placed about 9 feet up, beside a large beam or pole near the tent's outer edge [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-09-23 Renewal Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-09-23-renewal-regular/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-09-23 Renewal Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-09-23-renewal-regular/) [5]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-09-23 Renewal Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-09-23-renewal-regular/) [6]",
